Jarek:

Shall I repeat what I wrote this morning? Did you actually try omitting 
the x+y in the formula? Including a drift in untransformed coordinates is 
very likely to lead to numerical chaos. If z~1 works, then the smoking gun 
is the x+y, isn't it? If you want them, transform them (offset with for 
example elide() in maptools and transform back afterwards).

Roger

